  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <h2>Work that moved trials forward</h2>
      <p class="lede">Six projects, from the regulatory strategy behind a Phase 3 endpoint down to the hardware inside the scanner.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">Takeda, 2020 to 2024</span>
        <h3>MRI as a co-primary endpoint in Phase 3</h3>
        <p>Led imaging strategy for a cell therapy program in perianal fistulizing Crohn's disease, where the MRI-based central read was a co-primary endpoint.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">AstraZeneca, 2025</span>
        <h3>An FDA briefing document for a rare liver disease</h3>
        <p>Wrote the briefing document proposing MR elastography and gadoxetate-enhanced MRI as imaging endpoints for an early-stage primary sclerosing cholangitis study.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">Parexel, 2014 to 2020</span>
        <h3>Oncology imaging lead across dozens of global trials</h3>
        <p>Put RECIST 1.1, Lugano and PCWG2 response criteria into practice across multi-center trials, and wrote the review charters and CT, MRI and PET/CT acquisition guidelines behind them.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">Takeda, 2020 to 2024</span>
        <h3>Validating AI readouts and new PET tracers</h3>
        <p>Took part in validating an AI-assisted imaging algorithm for regulatory-grade IBD readouts, and co-led collaborations validating PET radiotracers in liver fibrosis and fibrostenotic Crohn's disease.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">Aurora Imaging, 2008 to 2010</span>
        <h3>Systems engineering for a dedicated breast MRI scanner</h3>
        <p>RF and gradient hardware and software integration, performance verification, and breast PET-MRI detector integration with Brookhaven National Laboratory.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><span class="mono">Pfizer, 2010 to 2012</span>
        <h3>Preclinical cardiac MRI and spectroscopy at 7 T</h3>
        <p>Designed and validated cardiac MRI and MR spectroscopy protocols, and proposed in vivo liver lipid spectroscopy as a first-in-human clinical endpoint.</p></li>
    </ul>
